# JusticeTrack — Environment Variables
# Copy to `.env` for local dev. On Vercel, add these in Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# Lovable Cloud auto-injects these into Lovable previews. For Vercel deployment
# you must paste the actual values from your Lovable Cloud project.

